{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 40, :comments ["<b>Fruit of a beautiful tree, branches of palm trees</b> פרי עץ הדר in gematria = אתרוגים:" "<b>עבת</b> defective vav, on account of six things that disqualify it, and they are: dried, stolen, from an asherah, from an ir hanidachat, its tip is broken off, and that of idolatry:" "<b>Branches of palm trees</b> — this is the lulav. לולב in gematria = חיים, therefore dried is disqualified. עץ חיים — this is the lulav, which equals the numerical value of חיים, and likewise תודיעני אורח חיים."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:20:23.476058535Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}